  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(A) at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo></math> constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mi>mech</mi><mo>.&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>constant</mi></math></p><p>(B) at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo></math> constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mi>mech</mi><mo>.&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p>Particle is at rest.</p><p>(C) At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mi>mech</mi><mo>.&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KE</mi></math> is greatest, and particle is moving at fastest speed.</p><p>(D) At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p>"
